        <item>
            <title>0.2.2</title>
            <description sparkle:format="html"><![CDATA[
                <h3>What's new in v0.2.2</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Switching Sub2API upstream accounts now applies the selected account immediately and prevents an earlier refresh from overriding it.</li>
                    <li>Provider credential fields now remove unsupported non-ASCII and control characters as you type.</li>
                    <li>Improved the vertical alignment of values in the two-row menu-bar quota icon.</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
