            <title>0.2.1</title>
            <description sparkle:format="html"><![CDATA[
                <h3>What's new in v0.2.1</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Updated the menu-bar usage chart to show a rolling 30-day history with seven upcoming day slots.</li>
                    <li>Corrected Today and This Week placement across month boundaries, including clearer date labels and unclipped week markers.</li>
                </ul>
